<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/music>
    a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "GMEOW Music Module"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "The GMEOW Music Module — classes, properties, and individuals of the GMEOW super-vocabulary."@x-gmeow-english ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/music> ;
    rdfs:comment """Frame-relative musical content; every notation is a lossy projection.

This module is intentionally scaffold-only for the structural-foundation issue (#307).
The five planned layers are reserved as sections below; term declarations land in
their respective child issues (#308–#312, #314–#317)."""@x-gmeow-english ;
    dcterms:isPartOf <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow> .

